spec:
Write src/tokens.ts with no imports. Export these types: `export interface ThemeTokens { bgBase: string; bgSurface: string; bgRaised: string; bgOverlay: string; borderSubtle: string; textPrimary: string; textMuted: string; gold: string; nile: string; ochre: string; lapis: string }`; `export type CardStatus = "backlog" | "ready" | "doing" | "review" | "done"`; `export type CardClass = "feature" | "bug" | "chore" | "spike"`; `export type GateName = "typecheck" | "lint" | "test" | "bounds" | "visual"`; `export type GateState = "pass" | "fail" | "pending" | "skipped"`; `export interface CanvasCard { id: string; title: string; status: CardStatus; cardClass: CardClass; difficulty: 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5; stepsUsed: number; stepBudget: number; gates: Record<GateName, GateState>; dependsOn: string[] }`; `export interface DagNode { id: string; rank: number; order: number; x: number; y: number; width: number; height: number }`; `export interface DagEdge { from: string; to: string; path: string }`. Export values: `export const THEME: ThemeTokens` with keys in exactly this order and these upper-case values: bgBase "#14120F", bgSurface "#1C1A16", bgRaised "#24211C", bgOverlay "#2C2822", borderSubtle "#2E2A24", textPrimary "#EDE6DA", textMuted "#A39A8C", gold "#C8952A", nile "#4FA36B", ochre "#C9503F", lapis "#4C8ED9". `export const GATE_ORDER: GateName[] = ["typecheck", "lint", "test", "bounds", "visual"]`. `export function cssVarName(token: string): string` turns camelCase into a CSS custom property: "--" followed by the name with each upper-case letter replaced by "-" plus its lower-case form (bgBase -> --bg-base). `export function tokensToCss(theme: ThemeTokens): string` returns ":root {
" + one line per key in object order formatted as two spaces, cssVarName(key), ": ", value, ";" joined with "
" + "
}
". This project is ESM with moduleResolution nodenext: any relative import must end in .js (for example from "./tokens.js").
